  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan plans to add precaution Immortal Gu and formation path mortal Gu into vajra shell so the move’s power rises by multiple times.",
        "chapters": [
          1340
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_formation_path_mortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "It is one of the two Immortal Gu he took after joining Wu clan as Wu Yi Hai.",
        "chapters": [
          1346
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "fac_wu_clan",
          "char_wu_yi_hai"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "His first fusion test fails because he treats the tenth breath as the activation point; the Gu unleashes power at the eleventh breath, the killer move breaks, and he takes a backlash, though precaution Immortal Gu itself is not damaged.",
        "chapters": [
          1347
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "vajra-shell-timing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He later rebuilds vajra shell with time path mortal Gu that remove the ten-breath delay, so the precaution effect is active as soon as the move starts.",
        "chapters": [
          1353
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "vajra-shell-timing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_mortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He also uses it as the core of a Gu formation modified from Purple Mountain True Monarch’s inheritance.",
        "chapters": [
          1405
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "cores",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_formation",
          "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In another modified killer move, it and rule path Immortal Gu Big replace stubborn Immortal Gu and rule path Immortal Gu Main as the core.",
        "chapters": [
          1415
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "cores",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "As the defense core of Myriad Year Flying Warship it later takes heavy injury when many ship Gu are damaged.",
        "chapters": [
          1813
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "cores",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "house_myriad_year_flying_warship"
        ]
      }
    ]
